f. There really is no sponsor either for this page. I guess wikipedia and Youtube could be it. ANYWAY, a video that they wanted to be included in this oh so wonderful 90s music page.</p>\n               <embed width="560" height="315" src="https://www.youtube.com/embed/fXpfdq3WYu4">\n               <marquee scrollamount="50"><img src="https://media.giphy.com/media/jM4bWFBKpSFeo/giphy.gif" style="transform: scaleX(-1);"></marquee>\n               <!-- video that scrolls across screen, but also loops and autoplays as soon as the page opens-->\n               <marquee scrollamount="70"><iframe src="https://www.youtube.com/embed/dQw4w9WgXcQ?autoplay=1&loop=1" frameborder="0" width="50px" height="50px" loop></iframe></marquee>\n          </div>\n          <!-- Start of SimpleHitCounter Code -->\n          <div align="center">\n               <a href="http://www.simplehitcounter.com" target="_blank"><img src="http://simplehitcounter.com/hit.php?uid=0&f=16777215&b=0" border="0" height="18" width="83" alt="web counter"></a><br><a href="http://www.simplehitcounter.com" target="_blank" style="text-decoration:none;">web counter</a>\n          </div>\n          <!-- End of SimpleHitCounter Code -->\n\n          </section>\n     </body>\n</html>\n'

